      "writtenOn": "2026-06-30T17:42:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This serves as a safeguard for certain corner cases. For instance, when the gf_group is stationary on average but the arf\u0027s coded error is significantly larger, it indicates that the arf may not be a good reference frame. In such scenarios, lowering the qindex for this gf_group could result in excessive bit consumption.",
